// The SDL program's icons on Windows (stardraft-sdl.exe), the same as the Windows program's (stardraft.rc): SDL gives
// the first icon to its windows (the title bar, the taskbar, Alt+Tab), and Explorer shows it for the program file.
// Icon 1 (index 0): the program. Icon 2 (index 1): the documents (DefaultIcon "<exe>",1: maps and project.stardraft).
1 ICON "stardraft.ico"
2 ICON "stardraft-document.ico"
